{"id":"msg_m_ex_ade_03","cat":"messenger","group":{"id":"room_ade","label":"Ade · Nikke"},"label":"3. You look exhausted, Master.","stage":null,"prev":"msg_m_ex_ade_02","next":"msg_m_ex_ade_agentbunny_01","speakers":{"ade":"Ade"},"icons":{"ade":"si_c310_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"m_ex_ade_03_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"ade","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ade_03_1","text":"You look exhausted, Master.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ade_03_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"ade","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ade_03_2","text":"Have you been able to take sufficient rest lately? :(","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ade_03_3","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ade_03_3","text":"I haven't, but it's okay.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ade_03_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"ade","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ade_03_4","text":"I'm concerned about you.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ade_03_5","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ade_03_5","text":"I wish I could be as full of life as you, Ade.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ade_03_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"ade","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ade_03_6","text":"Hmm?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ade_03_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"ade","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ade_03_7","text":"How so?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ade_03_8","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ade_03_8","text":"You never seem to get tired.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ade_03_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"ade","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ade_03_9","text":"Ah, I see.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ade_03_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"ade","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ade_03_10","text":"Undoubtedly, there are moments when weariness sets in.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ade_03_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"ade","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ade_03_11","text":"Nevertheless, I am a maid.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ade_03_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"ade","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ade_03_12","text":"My sole purpose is to offer you an exquisite service,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ade_03_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"ade","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ade_03_13","text":"so it's imperative that I refrain from showing any trace of weariness in your presence.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ade_03_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"ade","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ade_03_14","text":"Don't worry about me.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ade_03_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"ade","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ade_03_15","text":"I always find ways to get ample rest.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ade_03_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"ade","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ade_03_16","text":"I do my utmost not to stretch myself too thin.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ade_03_17","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ade_03_17","text":"Awesome, I could definitely learn a thing or two from you.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ade_03_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"ade","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ade_03_18","text":"I appreciate you saying that.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ade_03_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"ade","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ade_03_19","text":"Your compliments never fail to uplift my spirits.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ade_03_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"ade","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ade_03_20","text":"They serve as a constant source of motivation","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ade_03_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"ade","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ade_03_21","text":"and affirm my belief that I can get through any challenges :)","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ade_03_22","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ade_03_22","text":"I'll have to praise you even more in the future, then.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ade_03_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"ade","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ade_03_23","text":"I am truly grateful","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ade_03_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"ade","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ade_03_24","text":"and eagerly look forward to it.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ade_03_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"ade","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ade_03_25","text":"As your maid, I shall consistently endeavor to bring you joy and satisfaction.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ade_03_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"ade","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ade_03_26","text":"So, Master...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ade_03_27","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ade_03_27","text":"Yes?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ade_03_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"ade","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ade_03_28","text":"May I kindly resume our previous conversation?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ade_03_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"ade","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ade_03_29","text":"Your well-being is of great importance to me,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ade_03_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"ade","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ade_03_30","text":"so I've acquired some tea","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ade_03_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"ade","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ade_03_31","text":"that can alleviate fatigue.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ade_03_32","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ade_03_32","text":"For me?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ade_03_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"ade","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ade_03_33","text":"Indeed,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ade_03_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"ade","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ade_03_34","text":"just for you.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ade_03_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"ade","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ade_03_35","text":"May I inquire if you are currently in your room?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ade_03_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"ade","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ade_03_36","text":"If it pleases you, I can come by with the tea leaves.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ade_03_37","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ade_03_37","text":"Of course, you can.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ade_03_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"ade","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ade_03_38","text":"Thank you, Master.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ade_03_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"ade","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ade_03_39","text":"I will be there shortly :)","jump":null}],"chat":true}